cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "cpt: a differentiable constraint projection layer for autoregressive models"
abstract: >-
  Code, artifacts and verification for "Steering Crystal Generation at Every Token:
  A Differentiable Constraint Projection for Autoregressive Models". Solves a convex
  constrained projection of the next-token distribution at every decoding step and
  trains through it, so one trained network serves a family of numerical property
  targets it never trained for.
repository-code: "https://github.com/KurbanIntelligenceLab/cpt"
license: MIT
